---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Raft Hike Tour"
  description="Raft Hike Tour Discover more with our Khao Sok FAQs"
  heroImage="/images/khao-sok-hero-cottages.jpg"
  heroTitle="Raft Hike Tour"
  heroSubtitle="Curated Rainforest Adventures & Park Excursions"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Faq Category", "href": "/faq-category/"}, {"label": "Raft Hike Tour", "href": "/faq-category/raft-hike-tour/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is Tam Kaew Cave safe to visit?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes, when visited with experienced guides. Visitor numbers are limited and guides lead all cave explorations to ensure safety and protect the cave environment.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What should I bring on the tour?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We recommend trekking shoes, insect repellent, water, swimwear and a small waterproof bag for valuables.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Where is Khlong Phanom National Park?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khlong Phanom National Park is located about 30–40 minutes from Khao Sok village in Surat Thani Province, southern Thailand.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How long does the Cave, Raft & Hike tour take?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The experience typically lasts 5–6 hours, including bamboo rafting, jungle hiking, cave exploration and lunch.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is the Cave, Raft & Hike tour suitable for beginners?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes. The tour is moderately active, but most visitors with basic fitness can participate. The jungle hike includes uneven terrain and short climbs.
        </p>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
